abstract: >-
  Deterministic reproducibility code for a regional gravitational-phase effective-theory programme,
  including regional geometry/history controls, cosmic-web obstruction tests, leaf-constrained
  active-charge diagnostics, causal/Kubo response, nonlinear 1PI and nucleation audits,
  phase–geometry feedback benchmarks, and global-competition identifiability tests.
